{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107815","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107815/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107815/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107815/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107815","id":3165248979,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc68qd3T","number":107815,"title":"`print_error()` in C++ doesn't apply rich formatting in terminal","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-06-21T17:24:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T22:05:45Z","closed_at":"2025-06-21T21:56:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.5.beta.custom_build [4e6ac9bcc]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (4e6ac9bcc) - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen working on the editor, the `print_error()` method displays the provided string normally in the terminal, making it easy to miss:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5284f57b-1ac9-417b-8d24-6e939438e26a)\n\nBy contrast, GDScript's `push_error()` method displays its text in red with a bold \"ERROR\" prefix, so that it sticks out immediately as a problem:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a212b7b7-8bc8-4b58-8735-6ae86c7093df)\n\n---\n\nThis behavior might be intentional; `print_error()`'s purpose may simply be to send its text to `stderr` instead of `stdout`, and not apply any extra formatting or data on top of the message. If so, and there's not a way for us to apply the formatting in the terminal without compromising that, then this is a non-issue. But I think it would be helpful to format this output if possible.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse the `print_error()` method in C++ engine code, and the `push_error()` method in GDScript code, when running Godot from the terminal.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107815/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}